WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:50.280
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:50.550 --> 00:51.760
How many more people will have to experience

3
00:51.843 --> 00:53.553
the same pain we went through, Alex?

4
00:53.636 --> 00:54.637
Enough, Alex.

5
00:54.721 --> 00:55.764
It's already too painful.

6
01:02.520 --> 01:07.692
Or maybe Mikoy is the key to bring down the whole agency.

7
01:14.157 --> 01:15.784
You are the person that has been with Chiara the longest.

8
01:15.867 --> 01:17.952
You're the only trainee she had.

9
01:18.036 --> 01:20.830
And you are the only person who knows her.

10
01:24.709 --> 01:26.419
We both know that when the two of you are facing each other,

11
01:26.503 --> 01:28.046
you'll be needing that kind of courage.

12
01:35.970 --> 01:36.971
What will you do, Chiara?

13
01:37.055 --> 01:38.681
Kill everyone who refuses to follow you?

14
01:38.765 --> 01:40.850
Of course not. That would be exhausting.

15
02:02.330 --> 02:03.248
So,

16
02:03.998 --> 02:05.041
it's confirmed?

17
02:19.097 --> 02:20.265
It's not that simple.

18
02:21.015 --> 02:23.143
Prague is Valtrovi territory.

19
02:23.935 --> 02:26.855
That's where their family is strongest, and they have people everywhere.

20
02:29.732 --> 02:32.610
Yup, and now that she's leading the Concordat,

21
02:32.694 --> 02:35.196
her network has expanded even further.

22
02:42.245 --> 02:43.830
Then we find a way she won't know about.

23
02:43.913 --> 02:45.039
Mikoy.

24
02:45.665 --> 02:47.584
We found her, didn't we?

25
02:47.667 --> 02:48.501
It's confirmed.

26
02:49.168 --> 02:50.378
What are we waiting for?

27
02:50.461 --> 02:52.714
A chance that we won't all die.

28
02:56.801 --> 02:57.635
So that's it?

29
02:58.386 --> 02:59.596
What do you mean by that?

30
02:59.679 --> 03:01.306
We found the person, didn't we?

31
03:01.806 --> 03:02.682
And we're not going to do anything?

32
03:03.808 --> 03:05.852
I'm not saying we're not going to do anything.

33
03:17.864 --> 03:18.865
What about us?

34
03:20.325 --> 03:21.701
What about all of us?

35
03:22.952 --> 03:24.120
Are you the only one going?

36
03:25.955 --> 03:28.541
Because the moment you authorize an operation,

37
03:28.625 --> 03:31.044
the whole agency is involved.

38
03:31.836 --> 03:33.254
I'm not forcing you to come.

39
03:37.300 --> 03:39.844
You're not thinking like part of the team anymore.

40
03:39.928 --> 03:41.930
All you care about is getting to Chiara.

41
03:42.013 --> 03:43.306
Of all of us here,

42
03:43.389 --> 03:45.600
I have the biggest reason to get to her,

43
03:45.683 --> 03:46.559
and you know that.

44
03:53.608 --> 03:54.734
What do you mean?

45
03:55.652 --> 03:56.861
Mikoy, you've lost someone.

46
03:57.612 --> 03:59.948
You're hurting. You're angry.

47
04:00.031 --> 04:01.282
And right now,

48
04:01.366 --> 04:03.576
you're letting your grief make the decisions for you.

49
04:03.660 --> 04:05.078
There you go again.

50
04:05.161 --> 04:06.871
You don't know how I feel.

51
04:08.665 --> 04:10.667
Then stop using your concern as an excuse

52
04:10.750 --> 04:12.335
for us to do nothing.

53
04:12.418 --> 04:14.087
Because I don't want anything bad to happen to you.

54
04:14.170 --> 04:16.005
Did I ask you to worry about me?

55
04:17.882 --> 04:19.884
Mikoy, this isn't about what you're asking for.

56
04:21.344 --> 04:24.806
It's my job to make sure the people with me make it home safely.

57
04:24.889 --> 04:27.642
And it's our job to go after criminals.

58
04:28.226 --> 04:29.185
Right?

59
04:31.729 --> 04:32.563
There she is.

60
04:34.023 --> 04:35.566
What are we waiting for?

61
04:54.460 --> 04:56.337
-Mikoy. -Mikoy!

62
05:14.063 --> 05:14.939
Mikoy.

63
05:15.565 --> 05:16.566
Mikoy.

64
05:23.740 --> 05:25.658
I know I'm not your father.

65
05:27.201 --> 05:30.288
And I have no intention of replacing Mario in your life.

66
05:31.789 --> 05:33.958
But I've known you for a long time.

67
05:34.042 --> 05:36.919
I've seen you scared.

68
05:37.420 --> 05:39.338
I've seen you

69
05:41.174 --> 05:42.508
make mistakes.

70
05:42.592 --> 05:44.177
I've seen you fight.

71
05:45.511 --> 05:47.889
And after all this time you've been with this agency,

72
05:47.972 --> 05:50.683
I've come to see you as my own son.

73
05:59.275 --> 06:05.156
That's why I can't just stand here and watch you like this.

74
06:07.700 --> 06:08.993
I'm okay, sir.

75
06:12.205 --> 06:14.582
I'm looking for justice for my father.

76
06:21.798 --> 06:22.882
Bok.

77
06:24.550 --> 06:25.927
Are you okay?

78
06:28.262 --> 06:29.222
I'm okay.

79
06:32.558 --> 06:33.643
But him?

80
06:33.726 --> 06:34.644
He doesn't look okay.

81
06:36.562 --> 06:38.147
He's just angry.

82
06:38.231 --> 06:39.690
Bok, it's not just anger.

83
06:40.525 --> 06:42.151
I don't know if you've noticed.

84
06:43.027 --> 06:43.861
What?

85
06:44.570 --> 06:45.446
Bok.

86
06:45.530 --> 06:47.156
Mikoy has changed.

87
06:47.657 --> 06:50.118
He's not the Mikoy we've known all these years.

88
06:51.410 --> 06:52.578
He doesn't stop training.

89
06:52.662 --> 06:55.331
And he barely sleeps anymore.

90
06:56.916 --> 06:58.835
His father just died.

91
07:00.211 --> 07:02.296
That's why I'm worried, Bok.

92
07:04.465 --> 07:05.842
He's still grieving.

93
07:05.925 --> 07:07.176
That doesn't mean that--

94
07:07.260 --> 07:09.595
Exactly. That's why I'm worried.

95
07:12.807 --> 07:14.350
What do you mean?

96
07:15.726 --> 07:18.354
Bok, I don't know if you've noticed…

97
07:21.607 --> 07:22.608
Bok.

98
07:23.776 --> 07:25.069
Justice?

99
07:27.572 --> 07:31.325
Or are you looking for someone to take your anger out on?

100
07:31.409 --> 07:33.619
We already know who killed him.

101
07:35.246 --> 07:36.956
So what's the problem?

102
07:37.039 --> 07:38.583
The problem is…

103
07:41.043 --> 07:43.671
my conscience won't let me,

104
07:43.754 --> 07:46.257
when Mario and I meet again,

105
07:46.340 --> 07:50.803
just stand by and let his son follow him right away.

106
07:50.887 --> 07:53.598
That's not the justice he wanted.

107
07:55.475 --> 07:57.935
Dad is gone. He can't tell us what he wants anymore.

108
08:01.814 --> 08:03.774
So don't use his name

109
08:03.858 --> 08:09.989
to justify something that you want to do.

110
08:14.744 --> 08:15.828
Bro.

111
08:23.169 --> 08:24.295
What are you doing here?

112
08:27.298 --> 08:28.841
Can we talk?

113
08:32.220 --> 08:34.096
Go, talk to each other.

114
08:53.824 --> 08:55.785
Even though he knows it could get him killed.

115
08:57.078 --> 08:58.746
I won't let that happen.

116
09:06.754 --> 09:09.215
Because I think Mikoy's biggest enemy right now

117
09:09.298 --> 09:10.383
is no one else

118
09:11.425 --> 09:13.135
but himself.

119
09:38.911 --> 09:39.787
Mom?

120
09:40.329 --> 09:41.539
How is she?

121
09:43.541 --> 09:44.750
She's okay.

122
09:45.960 --> 09:47.295
Or so she says.

123
09:52.717 --> 09:53.634
What about you?

124
09:55.928 --> 09:56.971
I'm okay too.

125
09:59.015 --> 10:00.016
Or so you say?

126
10:01.517 --> 10:02.685
Guess it runs in the family.

127
10:08.649 --> 10:09.817
Bro.

128
10:11.485 --> 10:13.529
We don't really get to talk anymore.

129
10:15.156 --> 10:16.574
But we're talking right now.

130
10:18.993 --> 10:20.911
What I mean is,

131
10:21.621 --> 10:24.707
ever since Dad passed away,

132
10:26.167 --> 10:29.253
it feels like we've all had our own things going on.

133
10:31.589 --> 10:34.508
Mom's been busy taking care of us,

134
10:35.760 --> 10:37.470
and I've been looking after Mom.

135
10:40.431 --> 10:41.265
And you?

136
10:42.808 --> 10:45.102
I don't know even know what you've been up to, bro.

137
10:48.397 --> 10:50.107
I just have something I need to take care of.

138
10:52.777 --> 10:53.903
For Dad?

139
10:59.825 --> 11:01.160
For Dad.

140
11:07.333 --> 11:08.751
I really miss him so much, bro.

141
11:10.294 --> 11:12.004
Sometimes I even forget.

142
11:13.672 --> 11:14.965
When I wake up,

143
11:15.758 --> 11:17.468
I think everything's still normal.

144
11:17.551 --> 11:18.677
Then,

145
11:19.637 --> 11:21.013
I look for him,

146
11:21.097 --> 11:22.973
wanting to talk to him.

147
11:24.308 --> 11:26.143
And then I remember…

148
11:29.647 --> 11:30.856
he's gone.

149
11:39.532 --> 11:40.616
What about you?

150
11:41.534 --> 11:42.993
Do you miss Dad?

151
11:47.123 --> 11:48.332
Every day.

152
11:54.380 --> 11:55.714
But I have to stay strong.

153
11:59.093 --> 12:01.679
Bro, you don't have to be strong around me.

154
12:02.179 --> 12:03.556
I'm your brother.

155
12:11.480 --> 12:13.315
I'm so angry, Angelito.

156
12:17.862 --> 12:20.239
I didn't even get to say a proper goodbye.

157
12:23.534 --> 12:25.369
There was still so much I wanted to tell him…

158
12:28.080 --> 12:29.957
and so much I wanted to do with him.

159
12:40.259 --> 12:41.218
Me too, bro.

160
12:55.065 --> 12:55.900
Bro.

161
12:56.692 --> 12:58.527
Please, don't leave me too.

162
13:32.895 --> 13:34.605
So what's the plan?

163
13:42.947 --> 13:44.907
I've already talked to Alex.

164
13:44.990 --> 13:47.910
I told her I'm a little worried about Mikoy

165
13:47.993 --> 13:50.996
because I don't think he's thinking clearly anymore.

166
13:53.207 --> 13:54.750
And she believed you?

167
13:56.794 --> 13:59.255
I don't need her to believe me.

168
13:59.338 --> 14:02.591
All I need is to give her a reason to doubt.

169
14:05.970 --> 14:07.680
And the best part is,

170
14:08.430 --> 14:10.432
I don't even have to lie.

171
14:11.016 --> 14:11.850
Because?

172
14:11.934 --> 14:15.771
Because Mikoy seems like a very unstable man,

173
14:15.854 --> 14:18.399
and anyone who sees him

174
14:18.482 --> 14:19.650
will believe it.

175
14:23.737 --> 14:24.780
If he gets killed?

176
14:29.326 --> 14:31.954
Or he has to do it himself.

177
14:32.496 --> 14:34.707
It has to be his own doing.

178
14:38.502 --> 14:39.920
But what about Alex?

179
14:42.214 --> 14:43.257
When that happens,

180
14:44.592 --> 14:47.303
that's when she'll think back to everything I told her.

181
15:00.649 --> 15:01.692
Hey, hey!

182
15:25.049 --> 15:28.177
Just make sure there's no evidence.

183
15:28.260 --> 15:30.054
Nothing that could make anyone suspect

184
15:30.137 --> 15:32.056
that someone else did it.

185
15:32.139 --> 15:33.599
A brokenhearted man

186
15:34.558 --> 15:35.976
and a grieving son

187
15:37.019 --> 15:38.020
who just couldn't take it anymore.

188
15:41.690 --> 15:42.524
It's perfect.

189
15:43.776 --> 15:45.819
They'll all think the same thing.

190
15:50.824 --> 15:52.534
You can't make a mistake.

191
15:53.869 --> 15:55.913
Because if Chiara finds out

192
15:55.996 --> 15:57.957
that we touched Mikoy…

193
15:58.040 --> 15:59.249
No.

194
16:03.337 --> 16:04.421
No one will ever know.

195
16:06.382 --> 16:07.508
End it well.

196
16:37.538 --> 16:38.831
I don't trust him.

197
16:39.999 --> 16:41.000
Who?

198
16:42.334 --> 16:43.252
Sianong.

199
16:45.170 --> 16:47.047
We've already talked about this.

200
16:47.131 --> 16:48.882
I still don't trust him.

201
16:51.301 --> 16:53.429
You're not supposed to trust him.

202
16:54.096 --> 16:55.180
What about you?

203
16:55.264 --> 16:56.432
Do you trust him?

204
16:58.851 --> 16:59.977
Mom, he's a traitor.

205
17:01.520 --> 17:03.313
If he betrayed GAGO,

206
17:03.397 --> 17:06.150
what assurance do we have that he won't do the same to us?

207
17:06.984 --> 17:10.654
He knows what will happen to him if he does.

208
17:14.199 --> 17:15.159
What if that's not enough?

209
17:16.994 --> 17:17.995
What if he can't do it?

210
17:27.546 --> 17:28.881
you'll do it.

211
18:23.268 --> 18:27.147
The mission transfers to you, my dear.

212
18:30.275 --> 18:32.611
If Sianong can't do it anymore,

213
18:33.195 --> 18:34.488
you finish it.

214
18:36.657 --> 18:39.743
That's why I had you trained your whole life,

215
18:39.827 --> 18:42.246
to do things like this.

216
18:43.330 --> 18:44.581
You can handle it.

217
19:07.563 --> 19:09.273
You want me to kill Brother Mikoy?

218
19:09.857 --> 19:12.401
I want you to do what you have to do.

219
19:12.484 --> 19:13.318
But, Mom…

220
19:17.906 --> 19:19.741
If Sianong fails,

221
19:54.109 --> 19:55.360
You've been caught like this so many times,

222
19:55.444 --> 19:56.904
and you still haven't learned.

223
20:04.661 --> 20:05.662
You've gotten heavier.

224
20:20.677 --> 20:21.762
Is that for me?

225
20:36.109 --> 20:36.985
Sianong.

226
20:38.570 --> 20:39.613
Bok.

227
20:39.696 --> 20:40.656
Don't move.

228
20:40.739 --> 20:42.741
Or I swear I'll shoot you!

229
20:43.784 --> 20:44.743
So it's true.

230
20:45.244 --> 20:47.663
There really is a traitor in the agency.

231
20:55.045 --> 20:55.879
You?

232
21:01.593 --> 21:03.428
I trusted you.

233
21:03.929 --> 21:05.973
We trusted you.

234
21:07.766 --> 21:08.934
Who's giving you orders?

235
21:10.477 --> 21:12.020
Who are you working for?

236
21:14.856 --> 21:15.774
The Concordat?

237
21:16.775 --> 21:17.985
Chiara?

238
21:28.120 --> 21:28.996
Carlota.

239
21:30.163 --> 21:31.623
Don't talk to me.

240
21:36.962 --> 21:38.839
What else is there to explain?

241
21:40.799 --> 21:42.092
While I was with you,

242
21:42.801 --> 21:45.137
while I trusted you,

243
21:45.846 --> 21:47.556
you were just using all of us.

244
21:47.639 --> 21:49.349
I didn't use you, okay?

245
21:49.975 --> 21:51.059
No.

246
21:52.602 --> 21:53.687
You know me.

247
21:55.522 --> 21:56.690
Carlota.

248
21:57.274 --> 21:58.984
We're done.

249
22:04.072 --> 22:04.906
Just like that?

250
22:12.122 --> 22:14.166
I don't even know what's real anymore.

251
22:14.249 --> 22:15.083
Us.

252
22:15.792 --> 22:16.877
We are what's real!

253
22:17.836 --> 22:19.004
Carlota.

254
22:31.349 --> 22:33.268
Carlota, compared to anyone else,

255
22:33.351 --> 22:35.729
you're the one who knows me best.

256
22:39.107 --> 22:40.734
I love you.

257
22:44.196 --> 22:45.739
I love you so much.

258
22:59.377 --> 23:00.378
Don't come any closer.

259
23:02.506 --> 23:04.591
-I'm going to do it. -Sianong, that's enough!

260
23:09.387 --> 23:10.222
Alex.

261
23:10.931 --> 23:12.057
-Mikoy! -Mikoy?

262
23:12.140 --> 23:13.100
Mikoy again?

263
23:13.725 --> 23:16.603
Mikoy, Mikoy, Mikoy again!

264
23:17.145 --> 23:19.523
Sianong, let Carlota go.

265
23:19.606 --> 23:21.483
No one's going to chase you.

266
23:28.615 --> 23:29.491
Let her go.

267
23:59.521 --> 24:01.690
-He likes to make plans. -Sianong?

268
24:01.773 --> 24:05.110
He even made a list of places he wanted to visit.

269
24:05.193 --> 24:06.069
-Wait. -What?

270
24:06.153 --> 24:07.320
Italy.

271
24:07.404 --> 24:09.030
-Castellani. -What?!

272
24:09.114 --> 24:10.490
Castellani!

273
24:18.081 --> 24:19.124
Have you seen Sianong?

274
24:19.207 --> 24:21.585
Ma'am, we've been here for a while, and we haven't seen him.

275
24:21.668 --> 24:23.587
Agent Alex, it's open. He might come in through here.

276
24:23.670 --> 24:25.505
Stay here and let us know if you see him.

277
24:27.007 --> 24:29.134
Ouch!

278
24:29.217 --> 24:30.051
Easy.

279
24:30.135 --> 24:31.136
Where's Sianong?

280
24:31.219 --> 24:32.929
-He's the mole. -Where is he?

281
24:33.013 --> 24:33.972
He escaped.

282
24:34.055 --> 24:34.973
How about Mikoy?

283
24:35.056 --> 24:36.558
He's with Alex.

284
24:36.641 --> 24:37.809
They're after him.

285
24:40.270 --> 24:43.148
-Yes? -I need help. They're after me.

286
24:47.360 --> 24:49.112
-And you failed! -Was that all for nothing?

287
24:49.196 --> 24:50.530
This is where it ends, Sianong.
